%% title: The three states of results
%% desc: An exam starts as Draft. Processing the results makes them Processed, and they can be processed again. Publishing lets guardians see them and lets you send the SMS. Reopening needs extra approval and puts the state back to Processed.
flowchart LR
  D["Draft"]:::note -->|"Process result"| P["Processed"]:::admin
  P -->|"Process again"| P
  P -->|"Publish"| U["Published<br/>guardians can see"]:::guardian
  U -->|"Send result SMS"| M["SMS on the<br/>guardian's phone"]:::guardian
  U -->|"Reopen<br/>extra approval"| P
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
